# hotspots domain

- Preserve log-format contracts for `-c git` and `-c git2`; do not invent
  silent format guessing.
- Function grain must stay fail-closed — no silent fallback to file grain on
  missing repo, git errors, or unparsable `.rs`.
- Risk, ownership, and related scores are **indicators** (investigate), not
  blame or defect probability.
- Prefer [README.md](../../../README.md) and CLI help as UX source of truth.
- Read [`.agents/skills/hotspots-domain/SKILL.md`](../../skills/hotspots-domain/SKILL.md)
  before changing parsers, analyses, grain, or CLI flag semantics.
